etymologies.etymology_text:
==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
{{af|egy|ꜣḫ|t1=to be(come) effective, useful, splendid|n|t2=for}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Interjection===
{{egy-interj|head=<hiero>Ax-x:Y1-n</hiero>}}

# {{lb|egy|with following noun or suffix pronoun}} it’ll do (someone) [[good]], it’ll be good/beneficial for (someone)
#* {{c.|1506–1493 {{BCE}} (reign of {{w|Thutmose I}})}}, Memorial stele of the Overseer of the Sculptors Djehuti in his tomb at Kōm el-Aḥmar ({{w|Hieraconpolis}}), lines 18–23:<ref>{{R:egy:Urk|IV|133.7–133.16}}</ref>
#*: {{quote|egy|<hiero>i-A2-wab-A1-nb-H-Xr-b-A1-nb-Y4-<!--19-->nb-!-p:a:t-Z3-nb:t-rxyt-i-i-t-nb:t-H-m-m-[[*t*]]:H_SPACE-N8:Z2ss-nb:t-anx-Z3-tp*Z1:Z2-N17:N21*Z1-!-Z9:t:D54-t:f:y-<!--20-->Hr:Z1-i-iz-s-y:pr-p:n-!-H-Hz-t:n:Z2-mr-i-i-T:n:Z2-nTr:Z2-t:n:Z2-niwt:t-tyw-Z3-wn:N35C-t:n:Z2-tp*Z1:N17:N21*Z1-<!--21-->[[-…<!--23-->-]]-!-d-m-T30-A2-T:n:Z2-r:n-A2-A1-Ax-x:H_SPACE-Y1V-n:t:n:Z2</hiero>
|tr=j wꜥb nb ẖrj-ḥꜣb nb zẖꜣw nb pꜥt nbt rḫyt nbt ḥmmt nbt ꜥnḫw tp(j)w tꜣ swꜣt(j).fj ḥr jzj pn ḥz.tn mry.ṯn nṯrw.tn nwtjw wnn.tn tp tꜣ […] dm.ṯn rn.j '''ꜣḫ n'''.tn
|O every cleaner-priest, every lector-priest, every scribe, all patricians, all commoners, all sunfolk, living ones who are on the earth, who will pass by this tomb, you will be favored, you will be loved by your municipal gods so long as you exist on the earth: […] Pronounce my name! '''It will do''' you '''good'''.}}
#* {{c.|1458 {{BCE}}}}, Second biographical inscription of {{w|Ineni}}, from the second memorial stele of {{w|TT81|his tomb}}, lines 12–13:<ref>{{R:egy:Urk|IV|65.15–66.2}}</ref>
#*: {{quote|egy|<hiero>[[-U3-]]-t:n-[[-n-t:n:Z2-]]-<!--13-->b-i-W10*t:Y1-A1-ir:Z2-mi-t:t-Y1V-i-r:Z2-!-Ax-x:H_SPACE-n-T:n-wAH-H-Y1V-anx-T:n:Z2-tp*Z1:N17-w-DA-A-Y1V-tyw-n:y</hiero>
|tr=[mꜣ].tn [n.tn] bjꜣt.j jr mjtt jr(j) '''ꜣḫ n'''.ṯn wꜣḥ ꜥnḫ.ṯn tp(j) tꜣ wḏꜣ.tjwnj
|[See] my character and do likewise (lit. do the like concerning it). '''It will do''' you '''good'''; your life on the earth will endure, so that you are sound.}}
# {{&lit|egy|ꜣḫ|n}}

===References===
* {{R:egy:Wb|1|14.19–14.24}}
* {{R:egy:Faulkner|4}}
<references/>

