# {{lb|egy|Old Egyptian}} [[these]] [[two]], [[those]] [[two]]

====Usage notes====
This demonstrative takes the same functions as {{m|egy|jptnj}}; see the usage notes there. This term is only attested in archaizing post-Old Kingdom texts.

====Inflection====
{{Egyptian demonstratives}}

====Alternative forms====
{{egy-hieroforms
|p*t:n-t|read1=ptnt}}

===References===
* {{R:egy:TLA|jptntj|851275}}
* {{R:egy:Wb|1|70.8}}
* {{R:egy:Faulkner|17}}
* {{R:egy:Edel|83 et seq.|182 et seq.}}
* {{R:egy:Plural|63–64|62}}

===Etymology 1===
Likely from {{m|egy|jfdw||four}}, with an original meaning of ‘run on all fours’ and so ‘run away like a wild animal’.<ref>{{R:cop:Černý|232}}</ref> Compare {{m|egy|jfdt||all fours}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{egy-IPA-R|o=ˈjaːfatʼ|m=ˈjaːfatʼ|ml=ˈʔaːfətʼ|l=ˈʔoːfətʼ}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

==Egyptian==
{{number box|egy|4}}

===Etymology===
Compare {{cog|ha|huɗu}}, {{cog|bej|fadhig}} and {{cog|bid|paɗaŋ}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-R|o=jafˈtʼaw|m=jafˈtʼaw|ml=ʔəfˈtʼaw|l=ʔəfˈtʼaw
|onote=<!--jifˈdaw?--><ref>{{R:egy:Loprieno|37, 245}}</ref>
|mlnote=; compare the Akkadian transcription in {{cog|akk-mbb|𒁉𒁕𒌑|tr=⸢pi<sub>2</sub>⸣-⸢ṭa⸣-u<sub>2</sub>|ts=piṭau}}}}
{{egy-IPA-E|jfd_w}}

==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|egy|jfd <t:four-weave linen>|nṯr <t:god>}} in a direct genitive construction, thus ‘four-weave linen of the god’; or else the last element may represent {{m|egy|nṯrj||divine textile}}. {{egy-ht}}

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E}}

==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
{{af|egy|jmꜣḫw|t1=revered one|ḫr|t2=in the presence of, before|nṯr-ꜥꜣ|t3=Elder God|pos3=epithet of Osiris}}, thus literally ‘one revered before the Elder God’.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-R|o=jaˈmaʀχaw χuɾ ˌnacaɾˈʕaʀ|m=jaˈmaʀχaw χuʔ ˌnataʔˈʕaʀ|ml=ʔaˈmaːχə χuʔ nətəˈʕaʔ|l=ʔaˈmoːχ χøʔ nətəˈʕaʔ}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{af|egy|m <t:in>|-j <pos:[[nisba]] ending>}}. For the initial {{m|egy||j-}}, compare the adverbial and pre-pronominal form of {{m|egy|m}}, {{m|egy|jm}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{egy-IPA-R|o=jaˈmij|m=jaˈmij|ml=ʔəˈmeʔ|l=ʔəˈmeʔ}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

