===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|egy|hide}}
Compare {{cog|ar|ء م ن}} and {{cog|he|א־מ־ן|tr=ʾ-m-n}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{egy-IPA-R|q=proper noun|o=jaˈmaːnuw|m=jaˈmaːnuw|ml=ʔaˈmaːnə|l=ʔaˈmoːn
|onote=<ref>Schenkel, Wolfgang (1990) ''Einführung in die altägyptische Sprachwissenschaft'', page 89</ref>}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

==Egyptian==
{{wikipedia|Amenemhat}}

