===Etymology===
{{af|egy|jmn|t1=[[Amun]]|ḥtp|alt2=ḥtp(.w)|t2=is satisfied}}, masculine third-person singular stative form of {{m|egy|ḥtp||to satisfy}}, thus literally ‘Amun is satisfied’.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-R|ml=ʔamanˈħatpə|l=ʔamənˈħatp}}
{{egy-IPA-E|jmn-ḥtp|jmn-ḥotp}}

