==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
{{af|egy|jnr|t1=stone|ḥḏ|t2=white|mnḫ|t3=effective, worthwhile|n|alt4=n(j)|t4=of|rwḏt|t5=hard stone}}, thus literally ‘worthwhile white stone of hard rock’.

