{{af|egy|jnr|t1=stone|ḥḏ|t2=white|nfr|t3=pleasing, fine|n|alt4=n(j)|t4=of|rwḏt|t5=hard stone}}, thus literally ‘fine white stone of hard rock’.

===Pronunciation===
