==Egyptian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|egy|/nej/|a=Late Egyptian}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Determiner===
{{egy-det|p|head=<hiero>n:A-y</hiero>}}

# {{lb|egy|Late Egyptian}} [[these]], [[those]]

====Usage notes====
This demonstrative was primarily a determiner but could also be used alone, as a pronoun. When used as a determiner it precedes the noun it describes.

====Inflection====
{{Egyptian demonstratives}}

====Alternative forms====
{{egy-hieroforms
|<hiero>n:A</hiero>|read1=nꜣ
|<hiero>n:A-Z3</hiero>|read2=nꜣ}}

