==Egyptian==

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Determiner===
{{egy-det|p|head=<hiero>n:A-i-i</hiero>}}

# {{lb|egy|Late Egyptian|with attached suffix pronoun}} {{ng|forms [[possessive]]s}}; [[my]], [[our]], [[your]], [[his]], [[her]], [[its]], [[their]], {{ng|depending on which suffix pronoun is attached}}

====Usage notes====
This determiner modifies plural nouns, but it does not specify that the possessor is plural; the gender and number of the possessor are specified by the attached suffix pronoun.

====Inflection====
{{Egyptian demonstratives}}

For the possible suffix pronoun endings, see [[:Template:Egyptian personal pronouns]].

====Descendants====
* {{desc|der=1|cop|ⲛⲁ-|ⲛⲉⲕ-|ⲛⲟⲩ-|ⲛⲉϥ-|ⲛⲉⲥ-|ⲛⲉⲛ-|ⲛⲉⲧⲛ̄-|ⲛⲉⲩ-}}

