==Egyptian==
{{was fwotd|egy|2024|October|25}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|egy|s-|pos1=causative prefix|mꜣꜥ-ḫrw|t2=to be judged righteous, to be justified}}. Equivalent to {{af|egy|smꜣꜥ|t1=to set right|ḫrw|t2=voice}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Etymology 1===
Related to {{m|egy|snwj||two}}. Compare with {{cog|mmy|sin}}, {{cog|bej|san}} and {{cog|byn|dan|shan}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{egy-IPA-R|o=san|m=san|ml=san|l=san
|onote={{q|singular}}; {{IPA|egy|/saˈnuːwaw/}} {{q|plural}}<ref name="Loprieno">{{R:egy:Loprieno|46, 53, 55}}</ref>
|mnote={{q|singular}}; {{IPA|egy|/saˈnuːwaw/}} {{q|plural}}
|mlnote={{q|singular}}; {{IPA|egy|/səˈnuːwə/}} {{q|plural}}
|lnote={{q|singular}}; {{IPA|egy|/səˈneːw/}} {{q|plural}}}}
