<references />

{{c|egy|Male family members}}

etymologies.etymology_text:
==Egyptian==
{{number box|egy|2}}

===Etymology===
Suffixed with {{af|egy|-wj|pos1=dual ending}}. The root {{m|egy||sn-}} is likely the same root found in {{m|egy|sn||brother}}.<ref>Allen, James P. (2013) ''The Ancient Egyptian Language: An Historical Study'', New York: Cambridge University Press, page 60</ref> Compare it also with {{cog|sem-pro|*ṯin-}} and {{cog|tzm|ⵙⵉⵏ}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-R|o=siˈnuwwaj|m=siˈnuwwaj|ml=səˈnuwwə|l=səˈnøww
|onote=<ref>{{R:egy:Loprieno|47, 71}}</ref>}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
{{affix|egy|snb|gloss1=to be(come) healthy|.tj|pos2=second-person singular stative ending}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Interjection===
{{egy-interj|head=s-n:b-ti}}

# [[farewell]], [[goodbye]], [[have]] a [[safe]] [[trip]]
#* {{Q|egy||ShS.|line 158|quote=<hiero><!--158-->aHa-a:n-D:d-n:f-n:A1-s-n:b*t-zp:y-n:D-z:nDs-A1-r-pr-Z1-k\</hiero>
|tr=ꜥḥꜥ.n ḏd.n.f n.j '''snb.t(j)''' zpwj snwj nḏs r pr.k
|t=Then he said to me, '''Safe travels''', safe travels, little man, to your house!}}

====Alternative forms====
{{egy-hieroforms
|<hiero>s-n:b-t</hiero>|read1=snb.t}}

===References===
* {{R:egy:Allen|218}}
* {{R:egy:Hoch|116}}

==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
{{compound|egy|snb|gloss1=be healthy|.t|alt2=.t(j)|pos2=second-person singular stative ending|ꜥnḫ|gloss3=to live|.t|alt4=.t(j)|pos4=second-person singular stative ending}}, thus literally ‘you being healthy and alive’.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E}}

===Phrase===
{{head|egy|phrase|head=<hiero>s-n:b*t-anx-n:x*t</hiero>}}

# {{ng|Used to make a polite request;}} [[if you please]], [[please]].

===References===
* {{R:egy:Allen|221}}

==Egyptian==
{{wikipedia|Sneferu}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|egy|snfr|wj|gloss1=to make pleasing, fine, beautiful|gloss2=me}}, thus ‘[he] has made me fine’; compare the longer form in the [[serekh name]] {{m|egy|nb-mꜣꜥt-snfr-wj|lit=the possessor of righteousness has made me fine}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-E|s_nfr-wj}}

