* {{R:egy:Beckerath|52–53, 178}}
* Lepsius, Carl Richard (1849) ''Denkmaeler aus Aegypten und Aethiopien'', Abtheilung II, plate 17a

etymologies.etymology_text:
==Egyptian==

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-R|o=ˈsaːnaħ|m=ˈsaːnaħ|ml=ˈsaːnəħ|l=ˈsoːnəħ
|onote=<ref>Allen, James (2013) ''The Ancient Egyptian Language: An Historical Study'', Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, {{ISBN|9781107664678}}, page 24</ref>}}
