{{af|egy|gs|t1=half, side|tp|t2=head}} in a direct genitive construction, thus ‘half of the head’ or ‘side of the head’.

===Pronunciation===
{{egy-IPA-R|o=ˌkʼasˈtʼap|m=ˌkʼasˈtʼap|ml=kʼəsˈtʼap|l=kʼəsˈtʼap}}
