{{egy-IPA-E}}

==Egyptian==

===Etymology===
{{af|egy|ḏḥwtj|t1=Thoth|msj|alt2=ms|t2=to give birth|.w|alt3=(.w)|pos3=masculine third-person singular stative ending}}, thus ‘Thoth is born’.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|egy|/tʼaˈħawtij ˈmissaw/|a=Middle Egyptian}}
{{egy-IPA-E}}

