==Egyptian==

===Glyph origin===
Representing the leaf, stalk and rhizome (or a mound of earth) of the lotus. In general, the stem and base red, and the leaf green or yellow.

===Symbol===
{{head|egy|symbol|head=<hiero>M12</hiero>}}

# {{ng|[[biliteral|Biliteral]] [[phonogram]] for {{m|egy|ḫꜣ}}.}}
# {{ng|[[logogram|Logogram]] for {{m|egy|ḫꜣ||one thousand}}.}}

